<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus tenders for 25,000 tonnes feed barley.</title>
<headline>Cyprus tenders for 25,000 tonnes feed barley.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission said it invited tenders to supply one cargo of 25,000 tonnes of feed barley, with shipment between September 25 and October 10 from Europe or between September 15 and September 30 from North America.</p>
<p>Tenders will be examined on September 3, the Commission said.</p>
</text>
